    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a1Introduction</h2>Huh... umm...?<br>Meet Yuu, our hero who just can't jump high enough to escape their tiny little world.<br>But wait\u2014here comes YOU, the super hacker extraordinaire! \ud83d\udcbb\u2728<br>Hack Yuu's parameters, tweak the world itself, and guide them all the way to their happy ending! Let\u2019s get hacking!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a1 What's This Game About?</h2>You're a super hacker! \ud83d\udda5\ufe0f<br>Your mission? Hack the system and this game's world to guide Yuu, who just keeps wandering around on their own.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3419090/extras/276e4e324a3b2b691b1aa169a5f8d5e4.avif?t=1736597901\" width=478 height=184 /></span><br><br>Boost Yuu\u2019s jump power to reach new heights,<br>crank up their speed to explore far-off places,<br>or tweak gravity to save them from sticky situations!<br><br>But why is Yuu stuck in this strange loop?<br>There\u2019s a mystery hiding in this world.<br><br>As you adventure with Yuu, you\u2019ll unlock more hacking abilities to bend the rules of the game.<br>Use those powers to carve a path forward and experience the story you\u2019ll share with Yuu.<br>The journey is waiting\u2014let\u2019s hack our way to the truth!",
